---
import { STORE_URL } from '../data/site'

const rows = Array.from({ length: 6 }, (_, i) => i)
---

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="glow glow-a" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="glow glow-b" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal><b>Extensión de Chrome</b> · Gratis · Para vendedores de lives</p>

      <h1 data-split><span class="ln">El chat va a <span class="glitch">mil.</span></span> <span class="ln">Tus pedidos no se pierden.</span></h1>

      <p class="lead" data-reveal>
        Vendly ordena el chat de tu live por cliente y arma cada pedido con un clic. Stock y cobros al día, sin salir
        de Chrome.
      </p>

      <div class="cta-row" data-reveal>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={STORE_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Instalar gratis en Chrome
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg>
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#como-funciona">Ver cómo funciona</a>
      </div>

      <p class="note mono" data-reveal>Chrome de computadora · sin cuentas · tus datos se quedan en tu navegador</p>

      <div class="mobile-note" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <strong>¿Estás en el celular?</strong>
          <span>Vendly funciona en Chrome de computadora. Mándate el enlace y ábrelo cuando vayas a transmitir.</span>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button" data-share>Enviarme el enlace</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stage" id="stage" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="stage-in" id="stageIn">
        <div class="feed" id="feed"></div>

        <div class="vp hero-vp" id="hvp">
          <div class="vp-head">
            <span class="vp-logo">vendly<i></i></span>
            <span class="vp-live">En vivo</span>
          </div>
          <div class="vp-tabs">
            <span class="vp-tab on">Chat</span>
            <span class="vp-tab">Pedidos</span>
            <span class="vp-tab">Catálogo</span>
            <span class="vp-tab">Clientes</span>
            <span class="vp-tab">Ajustes</span>
            <span class="vp-tabline"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="vp-view">
            <div class="vp-search">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="M20 20l-3.5-3.5"></path></svg>
              Buscar por nombre, alias o mensaje
            </div>
            <div class="vp-stats">
              <span><b>6</b> personas</span>
              <span><b id="hMsgs">0</b> mensajes</span>
            </div>
            <div class="vp-card hlist" id="hlist">
              {rows.map((i) => <div class="vp-row hrow" data-row={i}></div>)}
            </div>
            <div class="vp-card hstrip" id="hstrip">
              <span class="hs-l">Por cobrar · <b id="hOrders">0</b></span>
              <b class="hs-v" id="hOwe">S/ 0.00</b>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    min-height: 100svh;
    padding: 132px 0 72px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    overflow: clip;
  }
  .glow {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -1;
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .glow-a {
    width: 1100px;
    height: 1100px;
    right: -380px;
    top: -420px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.3) 0%, rgba(254, 44, 85, 0) 66%);
  }
  .glow-b {
    width: 900px;
    height: 900px;
    left: -420px;
    bottom: -380px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(37, 244, 238, 0.16) 0%, rgba(37, 244, 238, 0) 66%);
  }
  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 0.96fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 72px);
  }
  .hero-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 26px;
  }
  .ln {
    display: block;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 5.6vw, 5.8rem);
    line-height: 0.93;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }
  .glitch {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--text);
    text-shadow:
      0.045em 0 var(--cyan),
      -0.045em 0 var(--pink);
    animation: glitch 4.2s steps(1, end) infinite;
  }
  @keyframes glitch {
    0%,
    86%,
    100% {
      text-shadow:
        0.045em 0 var(--cyan),
        -0.045em 0 var(--pink);
      transform: translate(0);
    }
    88% {
      text-shadow:
        0.09em 0.02em var(--cyan),
        -0.09em -0.02em var(--pink);
      transform: translate(0.02em, 0);
    }
    91% {
      text-shadow:
        -0.07em 0 var(--cyan),
        0.07em 0 var(--pink);
      transform: translate(-0.025em, 0.01em);
    }
    94% {
      text-shadow:
        0.045em 0 var(--cyan),
        -0.045em 0 var(--pink);
      transform: translate(0);
    }
  }
  .lead {
    max-width: 34em;
    color: var(--soft);
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.5vw, 1.3rem);
  }
  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .note {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }
  .mobile-note {
    display: none;
    width: 100%;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface);
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .mobile-note strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .mobile-note span {
    color: var(--soft);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .mobile-note .btn {
    min-height: 48px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  /* escenario: chat que se ordena */
  .stage {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 720px;
    aspect-ratio: 700 / 600;
    justify-self: end;
  }
  .stage-in {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    width: 700px;
    height: 600px;
    transform-origin: 0 0;
  }
  /* oculto hasta que el script lo escala y lo llena: evita ver la versión sin escalar y el salto */
  :global(html.js) .stage-in {
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .feed {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 20px;
    width: 270px;
    height: 560px;
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0, #000 70px, #000 100%);
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0, #000 70px, #000 100%);
  }
  .hero-vp {
    left: 280px;
    top: 20px;
  }
  .hlist {
    position: relative;
    height: 326px;
    flex: none;
  }
  :global(.hrow) {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    top: 0;
  }
  .hstrip {
    margin-top: auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    height: 52px;
    padding: 0 14px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .hstrip b {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .hs-v {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--pending) !important;
  }

  :global(.bub) {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    width: max-content;
    max-width: 258px;
    padding: 9px 22px 9px 9px;
    border-radius: 40px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11);
    will-change: transform;
  }
  :global(.bub .av) {
    flex: none;
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  :global(.bub .meta) {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }
  :global(.bub .un) {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #dcdee6;
  }
  :global(.bub .tx) {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  :global(.chip-fly) {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 5;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--pink);
    box-shadow: 0 0 24px 6px rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.7);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .hero {
      padding-top: 104px;
    }
    .hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .stage {
      justify-self: center;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .mobile-note {
      display: flex;
    }
  }
</style>
